2. Minimum requirements: (i) Kusum Seed shall be-
(a)
wholesome, mature, clean and dried ;
(b)
uniform in size, shape and colour,
(c)
free from living insects, dead insects and insect fragments;
(d)
free from fungus infestation, mould growth ;
(e)
free from added artificial colouring matter;
(f)
free from rodent hair and excreta;
(g)
free from other than Kusum seed;
(h)
free from rancidity and mustiness;
(ii)
the odour and flavour of the seeds when ground and moistened shall be fresh.
